  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1ee1a7ae94375407b8975550b39556cc, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LobbyInfoSlides
  slides:
  - title: What is wound care?
    description: 'Wound care is the process of cleaning, protcting, and treating
      a wound so it can heal properly and avoid infection. it includes steps like
      cleaning the wound, applying medication, and convering it with a sterile dressing '
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1775f3de814c44000b2c70b2c75cadb1, type: 3}
  - title: What is urinary catheterization?
    description: Urinary catheterization is a medical procedure where a thin, flexible
      tube is inserted into the bladder to drain urine.it is commonly used when a
      person cannot urinate on their own or need accurate urine output monitoring.
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d8ceab9c76d1f42d7bbc6fb99669e736, type: 3}
  - title: What is iv insertion?
    description: IV insertion involves placing a catheter into a vein to administer
      fluids or medications. The nurse identifies a suitable vein and inserts the
      cannula using sterile technique. The IV site is monitored regularly to prevent
      infection or infiltration.
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1ecc680afd04447b4806c22642ea5f1c, type: 3}
  - title: What is intramuscular Injection?
    description: IM injection delivers medication directly into a muscle for faster
      absorption. The nurse selects the correct site, cleans the area, and inserts
      the needle at the proper angle. Sterile technique is used to prevent infection
      and ensure patient safety.
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 322f59af47b994c95bab7c0c118405b7, type: 3}
  - title: What is subcutaneous Injection?
    description: Subcutaneous injection places medication into the tissue just beneath
      the skin. This method allows slow and steady absorption of the medication.
      Proper site selection and needle angle help reduce discomfort and complications.
    image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9794b274d29dc4574911b4168d9a1669, type: 3}
  titleText: {fileID: 91273504}
  descriptionText: {fileID: 329272157}
  procedureImage: {fileID: 670333081}
